  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 8228167680
    m_Localized: "Kuzey R\xFCzg\xE2r\u0131 ile G\xFCne\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13060005888
    m_Localized: "Kuzey R\xFCzg\xE2r\u0131 ile G\xFCne\u015F hangisinin daha g\xFC\xE7l\xFC oldu\u011Funu tart\u0131\u015F\u0131yorlard\u0131. Tam o s\u0131rada pelerine b\xFCr\xFCnm\xFC\u015F bir yolcunun yolda yakla\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6rd\xFCler. Yolcuya pelerinini \xE7\u0131kartt\u0131rmay\u0131 ba\u015Faran\u0131n daha g\xFC\xE7l\xFC say\u0131lmas\u0131na karar verdiler. \xD6nce Kuzey R\xFCzg\xE2r\u0131 var g\xFCc\xFCyle esmeye ba\u015Flad\u0131. Ne kadar \u015Fiddetli estiyse yolcu da pelerinine o kadar s\u0131k\u0131 sar\u0131ld\u0131. Sonunda Kuzey R\xFCzg\xE2r\u0131 pes etti. Ard\u0131ndan G\xFCne\u015F s\u0131cak \u0131\u015F\u0131nlar\u0131n\u0131 yolcunun \xFCzerine yaymaya ba\u015Flay\u0131nca yolcu pelerinini hemen \xE7\u0131kard\u0131. B\xF6ylece Kuzey R\xFCzg\xE2r\u0131, G\xFCne\u015F\u2019in kendisinden daha g\xFC\xE7l\xFC oldu\u011Funu kabul etmek zorunda kald\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
